{"quest_id": 4567, "name": "天才の機動戦術", "description": "高い機動力を活かし\n陸と空の両方から襲い来る\n魔物たちを迎え撃て！\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "妖魔の女王と戦術の天才", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920065, "map_no": 3180, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 32, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_speed": 16, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 53, "move_speed": 1300.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097184, "race_id": 11, "master_id": 2, "spawn_sec": 4}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "base_hp": 640, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 40, "attack_speed": 65, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097216, "master_id": 4, "spawn_sec": 46}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_range": 160, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 1800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098240, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 76, "global_id": 75, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 64}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2105776, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 718, "global_id": 717, "spawn_sec": 104}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1000, "base_hp": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "move_speed": 650.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097376, "master_id": 17, "spawn_sec": 107}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 2100, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2100, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 2000.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098256, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 15, "missile": {"speed": 2.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 77, "global_id": 76, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 123}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "ヘレナ、まさかアナタが負けるなんてねぇ。\n天才戦術家の二つ名はお飾りかしらぁ？", "face": "ldf5e1bdd1e51"}, {"name": "ヘレナ", "text": "……。", "face": "u354"}, {"name": "ゴブリンクイーン", "text": "あなたの戦術を頼りにしているのだから。\nきちんと結果をだしなさい？\nそれじゃあ、ワタシはもう行くわ……ウフフ。", "face": "ldf5e1bdd1e51"}, {"name": "ヘレナ", "text": "（……屈辱だな……操られたふりをして、\n無様に生き続けるなんて……。）", "face": "u354"}]}, {"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ユリアン", "text": "追いついたぞゴブリンども！\nもう逃げられ――ご、ゴブリンクイーン！？\nそれに、隣にいるあの女はいったい……？", "face": "u7"}, {"name": "ベルナール", "text": "ゴブリンクイーンは人間を操る術に長けている。\nどうやら才幹のある人間を催眠術にて\n自軍に引き入れたのであろうな。", "face": "u10"}, {"name": "ヘレナ", "text": "編成確認！　機動力の高い兵種を前線へ！\nお前達の俊足を用いて敵の陣形をかき乱せよ！\n（さぁ王子、もう少し力を見せてもらおうか……）", "face": "u354"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "人間同士が戦うなんて……。\nですが……戦うしかないのですね。\n王子、戦いのご準備を！", "face": "la0e94353615f"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ヘレナ", "text": "今回の戦いの目的は、敵戦力の算定だ。\n必要な情報は揃った！\n全軍、退却しろッ！　", "face": "u354"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "ギャギャッ！\n撤退ダ！　撤退ダッ！", "face": "le4066ac1ed12"}, {"name": "ヘレナ", "text": "(すごい……王子の力は想像以上だわ……。\nこれならば……きっと勝てる……。)", "face": "u354"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ベルナール", "text": "逃げられたか……しかしあの女性、かなりの\n戦術眼を持っているようだ。下等な魔物である\nゴブリンをあれほど巧妙に動かすとはな……。", "face": "u10"}, {"name": "へクター", "text": "前の戦いよりもゴブリン達が、\n戦略にそって戦うことに\n慣れ始めているような気がしました……。", "face": "u74"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "時間をおいては取り返しがつかなくなる\n危険がありますね……。\n王子、急ぎゴブリン達を追いかけましょう！", "face": "la0e94353615f"}]}], "active": true}